{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are an orange\u2014just an ordinary piece of fruit with an extraordinary dream.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world below is chaos: slippery surfaces, towering obstacles, and endless opportunities to fall. But somewhere above, beyond the madness, lies something greater\u2014a place where you truly belong. The fruit bowl. A symbol of purpose, of unity, of something more than just rolling around.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No one said it would be easy. The climb is unforgiving. There are no shortcuts. No checkpoints. Only determination, gravity, and you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But maybe, just maybe... this is your moment. A time to rise. To prove that even a small orange can defy the odds. To discover what you\u2019re really made of\u2014pulp and persistence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a journey of patience. Of failure. Of getting back up no matter how many times you fall. Are you ready to bounce?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3492490?t=1766327990","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492490/f569071db6e4adbe68c1702ece51e3b6d13d5fe6/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1766327990","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492490/0e06c56865b8b2f0ec5d61c7045c41843cca9ec0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766327990","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492490/0e06c56865b8b2f0ec5d61c7045c41843cca9ec0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766327990","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are an orange\u2014just an ordinary piece of fruit with an extraordinary dream.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world below is chaos: slippery surfaces, towering obstacles, and endless opportunities to fall. But somewhere above, beyond the madness, lies something greater\u2014a place where you truly belong. The fruit bowl. A symbol of purpose, of unity, of something more than just rolling around.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No one said it would be easy. The climb is unforgiving. There are no shortcuts. No checkpoints. Only determination, gravity, and you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But maybe, just maybe... this is your moment. A time to rise. To prove that even a small orange can defy the odds. To discover what you\u2019re really made of\u2014pulp and persistence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a journey of patience. Of failure. Of getting back up no matter how many times you fall. Are you ready to bounce?</p>","developers":["Vasileios Bekiaris"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492490/389c02a9969dea6705d30f3c2478229bbb4ee89a/header.jpg?t=1766327990","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Copyright Vasileios Bekiaris 2025","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3492490/645713564/79081f24d552f79add83fddc3b9e86fd315ec502/1750875400/dash_av1.mpd?t=1750886358","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3492490/645713564/79081f24d552f79add83fddc3b9e86fd315ec502/1750875400/dash_h264.mpd?t=1750886358","highlight":false,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3492490/645713564/79081f24d552f79add83fddc3b9e86fd315ec502/1750875400/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1750886358","id":257161457,"name":"Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257161457/aa93288a706fa78ed9bcb5a347df2b5572abf8a2/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1750886358"}],"name":"Orange Simulator","package_groups":[{"desc